--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party material
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Witcher 3, logo, icons & map are the property of CD PROJEKT RED and are used
without permission. Under section 9.4 of the CD PROJEKT RED User Agreement:

    If you create your User Generated Content using any of CD PROJEKT RED
    graphics, audio, video, text or any other content - you may use it and share
    for personal enjoyment, but we do not allow any use of it for financial
    profit.

This is why the NonCommercial term above is not negotiable: it is a condition the
material this project is built on already imposes.

The region maps under data/map/ were fitted against witcher3map by untamed0 and
contributors (https://github.com/untamed0/witcher3map), itself licensed
CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 and built from CD PROJEKT RED's map art under the same section 9.4.

The three files under mod/modWitcherTrack/content/scripts/game/ are CD PROJEKT RED's own
game scripts with seven one-line calls added; they are redistributed only because the
reporter cannot function without them, and every added line is marked and documented in
mod/HOOKS.md.

The savegame container format was established with reference to W3SavegameEditor by
Atvaark (https://github.com/Atvaark/W3SavegameEditor), MIT licensed.

This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by CD PROJEKT RED.

The in game timer was based on Gaztin (https://github.com/gaztin)'s work for the 
CDPR speedrunning community.